class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>New Jersey law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment of rent is a ground for removal under 2A:18-61.1(a), and 2A:18-61.2 excepts nonpayment (subsections a. or f.) from the written notice-to-quit requirement. (N.J.S.A. 2A:18-61.1(a); 2A:18-61.2; <a href='https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/2A_18_61.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Notice before suit: 3 days for disorderly conduct or injury to premises; 1 month for continued rules violation, substantial breach of covenant, or habitual failure to pay rent; 3 months for subsection g. grounds. (N.J.S.A. 2A:18-61.2(a)-(c); <a href='https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/2A_18_61.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Notice must specify in detail the cause of termination; no judgment of possession without written demand and notice (except nonpayment). (N.J.S.A. 2A:18-61.2; <a href='https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/2A_18_61.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord-tenant cases are filed in the Special Civil Part of Superior Court. (NJ Courts, Landlord/Tenant; <a href='https://www.njcourts.gov/self-help/landlord-tenant' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in New Jersey?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy New Jersey houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/new-jersey-squatters-rights-adverse-possession/'>New Jersey Squatters Rights and Adverse Possession</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/new-jersey-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/'>New Jersey Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/new-jersey-guides-by-city-and-county/'>New Jersey guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-new-jersey/'>We buy houses in New Jersey</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.nj.gov/dca/codes/codreg/pdf_regs/2A_18_61.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>N.J.S.A. 2A:18-61.1(a); 2A:18-61.2</a></li><li><a href='https://www.njcourts.gov/self-help/landlord-tenant' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>NJ Courts, Landlord/Tenant</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for New Jersey Eviction Notice Rules, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"New Jersey\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-new-jersey/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"New Jersey Eviction Notice: Types and Days\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/new-jersey-eviction-notice/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "New Jersey Eviction Notice: Types and Days", "rank_math_description": "New Jersey eviction notice rules: notice types, required days, which court hears the case and selling a rental. Official sources.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "new jersey eviction notice"}]